- Combine with transitions for smooth effects

### 🔍 DOM Selection Methods
```js
// By ID
document.getElementById("myId");

// By class (returns HTMLCollection)
document.getElementsByClassName("myClass");

// By tag name
document.getElementsByTagName("div");

// Modern selectors
document.querySelector(".myClass"); // first match
document.querySelectorAll(".myClass"); // all matches
```

### ⚡ Notes
- `getElementById` → single element
- `getElementsByClassName` / `getElementsByTagName` → live collections
- `querySelector` / `querySelectorAll` → NodeList (static)

### Example: Change Text
```js
const heading = document.querySelector("h1");
heading.textContent = "Hello World!";
```

### Best Practices
- Use `querySelector` for modern apps
- Cache selectors for performance

