### 🧠 Relationship Table
| Element | Role | Interaction |
|----------|------|-------------|
| **Component** | Defines view and logic | Uses directives and pipes in its template |
| **Directive** | Modifies DOM or behavior | Used inside component templates |
| **Pipe** | Transforms data for display | Used inside component bindings or interpolation |
